{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 612.0, 792.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [70.822265625, 42.5390625, 540.00244140625, 52.65521240234375], "text": "LAPTOP AOP / Macbook Solutions", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [73.0155029296875, 93.60577392578125, 238.38150024414062, 123.60577392578125], "text": "Laptop AOP", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [70.224609375, 160.875, 479.0979919433594, 226.9752197265625], "text": "The easy-to-use Laptop Alarm On Product (AOP) is beautifully designed to provide enhanced security, an optimal customer experience and a lower cost of operation. Laptop AOP is simple to install and to remerchandise. The IR port is easily accessible for daily operation, no tools are necessary to install, and there are flexible mounting options to accommodate different furniture styles.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [165.969140625, 247.074609375, 612.0, 452.112890625], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [69.626953125, 466.1134033203125, 162.28799438476562, 484.171875], "text": "At a glance:", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [70.822265625, 501.9609375, 189.8595428466797, 512.0704956054688], "text": "FEATURES AND BENEFITS", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [70.224609375, 520.91015625, 578.2990112304688, 572.9752197265625], "text": "", "type": "ListGroup"}, {"bbox": [70.5234375, 520.91015625, 264.6719970703125, 544.9752197265625], "text": "\u203a Enhanced laptop security with alarm-onproduct to deter theft", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [70.224609375, 548.3671875, 291.2810363769531, 572.9752197265625], "text": "\u203a Cut resistant steel cable with 24\" lift capability and 45lb pull force", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [311.9765625, 520.91015625, 507.9440002441406, 530.9752502441406], "text": "\u203a Can be mounted above or below counter", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [314.96484375, 534.05859375, 544.83203125, 558.9752197265625], "text": "\u203a \"Anti-grip\" design that mounts to flat and curved surfaces", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [312.